Here is the 3-step ritual for adding changes from here to github

Stage: git add .
Label (Commit): git commit -m "brief description of what you changed"
Send (Push): git push origin main

the steps for pulling new stuff from github
Bash
git fetch origin
(This tells your server: "Go check GitHub and see what's new, but don't change my files yet.")

Combine the changes:

Bash
git pull origin main
